### Compile current metadata into an active runtime package
POST http://localhost:3001/api/runtime-package/compile
x-tenant-id: demo
x-domain-code: DEFAULT
x-application-code: MAINTENANCE
x-user-id: studio-user
x-permissions: FORM.DESIGN,FORM.PUBLISH

### Current runtime package
GET http://localhost:3001/api/runtime-package/current
x-tenant-id: demo
x-domain-code: DEFAULT
x-application-code: MAINTENANCE
x-user-id: studio-user
x-permissions: FORM.DESIGN,FORM.PUBLISH

### Execute action and verify trace contains RUNTIME_PACKAGE
POST http://localhost:3001/api/runtime/WORK_ORDER/actions/replace-with-document-id/START
content-type: application/json
x-tenant-id: demo
x-domain-code: DEFAULT
x-application-code: MAINTENANCE
x-user-id: studio-user
x-permissions: WORK_ORDER.START,WORK_ORDER.READ,FORM.DESIGN,FORM.PUBLISH

{
  "payload": {
    "startedBy": "runtime-package-proof"
  }
}

### Proof expectations
# 1. POST /api/runtime-package/compile returns definition.status ACTIVE.
# 2. GET /api/runtime-package/current returns the same ACTIVE package.
# 3. Runtime action trace contains:
#    RUNTIME_PACKAGE SUCCESS
#    output.source COMPILED when a package is active.
# 4. Publishing metadata through Designer expires the previous package and activates the new version.
